<title>USA: Illinois Tool Works plans stock split.</title>
<headline>Illinois Tool Works plans stock split.</headline>
<dateline>GLENVIEW, Ill. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Illinois Tool Works said Friday its board declared a two-for-one common stock split, subject to approval by shareholders of an increase in the authorized shares to 350 million from 150 million.</p>
<p>The record date of the split is expected to be May 20, with distribution of shares on May 27.</p>
<p>Illinois Tool Works makes highly engineered components and industrial systems.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
